(129,'rt_ximenia_wp-template-options-override-widgets-2','a:3:{s:18:\"widget_gantry_menu\";a:1:{s:12:\"_multiwidget\";i:1;}s:23:\"widget_gantry_loginform\";a:1:{s:12:\"_multiwidget\";i:1;}s:18:\"widget_gantry_meta\";a:1:{s:12:\"_multiwidget\";i:1;}}','yes'),
(130,'rt_ximenia_wp-template-options-override-widgets-3','a:5:{s:18:\"widget_gantry_menu\";a:1:{s:12:\"_multiwidget\";i:1;}s:23:\"widget_gantry_loginform\";a:1:{s:12:\"_multiwidget\";i:1;}s:18:\"widget_gantry_meta\";a:1:{s:12:\"_multiwidget\";i:1;}s:11:\"widget_text\";a:7:{i:30005;a:14:{s:5:\"title\";s:24:\"Gantry Grid Distribution\";s:4:\"text\";s:333:\"<p>Configure at <strong>Admin Dashboard &rarr; Ximenia Theme</strong>, then go to <strong>Layouts</strong> to set the grid widths and allocated positions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"rt-center\"><img src=\"http://www.comunacorcova.ro/wp-content/rockettheme/rt_ximenia_wp/widget-positions/grid-distribution.jpg\" alt=\"image\" class=\"rt-image\" /></p>\";s:6:\"filter\";b:0;s:12:\"widget-style\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"box-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"title-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"block-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"shadow-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"corner-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"align-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"margin-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"padding-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"title-style\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"custom-variations\";s:0:\"\";}i:30006;a:14:{s:5:\"title\";s:22:\"Injected Gantry Gizmos\";s:4:\"text\";s:573:\"<p class=\"rt-center\"><img width=\"412\" height=\"170\" alt=\"Non-Standard Elements\" src=\"http://www.comunacorcova.ro/wp-content/rockettheme/rt_ximenia_wp/widget-positions/injected-features.jpg\" class=\"rt-image\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>There are <strong>Gizmos</strong> that are injected into a site when enabled in the <strong>Administrator</strong>, and are stacked vertically.</p> \r\n\r\n<p>These are the Google Analytics, Page Suffix, Smart Load Images, Typography Shortcodes, Page Class Suffix, RokStyle, Build Title-Spans, Disable Auto Paragraphs, Disable Texturize and IE6 Redirect.</p>\";s:6:\"filter\";b:0;s:12:\"widget-style\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"box-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"title-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"block-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"shadow-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"corner-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"align-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"margin-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"padding-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"title-style\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"custom-variations\";s:0:\"\";}i:30007;a:14:{s:5:\"title\";s:16:\"Forced Positions\";s:4:\"text\";s:458:\"<p>There are times when you just don\'t want to have your widgets taking up all the room in a horizontal row no matter what the layout. For example you might want to have a widget on the left and a widget on the right, with nothing in the middle.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This is made easy with Gantry with the Force Positions parameter for each layout, allowing you to set the count to a specific row number, such as 4, even if 4 widgets are not published for that row.</p>\";s:6:\"filter\";b:0;s:12:\"widget-style\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"box-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"title-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"block-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"shadow-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"corner-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"align-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"margin-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"padding-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"title-style\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"custom-variations\";s:0:\"\";}i:30008;a:14:{s:5:\"title\";s:24:\"MainBody/Sidebar Layouts\";s:4:\"text\";s:1340:\"<p>Configure at <strong>Admin Dashboard &rarr; Ximenia Theme &rarr; Layouts</strong> the varying Mainbody/Sidebar layout possibilities.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"rt-demo-width-33 rt-center rt-demo-block\">\r\n<div class=\"rt-demo-space\">\r\n  <img src=\"http://www.comunacorcova.ro/wp-content/rockettheme/rt_ximenia_wp/widget-positions/position-config-mb1.jpg\" width=\"290\" height=\"75\" class=\"rt-image\" alt=\"image\"/>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"rt-demo-width-33 rt-center rt-demo-block\">\r\n<div class=\"rt-demo-space\">\r\n  <img src=\"http://www.comunacorcova.ro/wp-content/rockettheme/rt_ximenia_wp/widget-positions/position-config-mb2.jpg\" width=\"290\" height=\"75\" class=\"rt-image\" alt=\"image\"/>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"rt-demo-width-33 rt-center rt-demo-block\">\r\n<div class=\"rt-demo-space\">\r\n  <img src=\"http://www.comunacorcova.ro/wp-content/rockettheme/rt_ximenia_wp/widget-positions/position-config-mb3.jpg\" width=\"290\" height=\"75\" class=\"rt-image\" alt=\"image\"/>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"clear\"></div><br />\r\n\r\n<p class=\"attention\">Note: If no widgets are assigned to the Sidebar positions, the Mainbody will become full width.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"rt-center\"><img class=\"rt-image\" width=\"920\" height=\"506\"  alt=\"Widget Positions\" src=\"http://www.comunacorcova.ro/wp-content/rockettheme/rt_ximenia_wp/widget-positions/gantry-layout.jpg\" /></p>\";s:6:\"filter\";b:0;s:12:\"widget-style\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"box-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"title-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"block-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"shadow-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"corner-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"align-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"margin-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"padding-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"title-style\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"custom-variations\";s:0:\"\";}i:30009;a:14:{s:5:\"title\";s:31:\"Basic: Using Layouts in Ximenia\";s:4:\"text\";s:752:\"<a rel=\"rokbox[745 505]\" title=\"Video Tutorial :: Using Gantry Layouts\" href=\"http://gantry-framework.org/videos/wordpress/widget_widths.mp4\">\r\n  <img class=\"rt-image rt-floatleft\" src=\"http://www.comunacorcova.ro/wp-content/rockettheme/rt_ximenia_wp/widget-positions/using-layouts.jpg\" alt=\"Using Layouts\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /></a>\r\n\r\n<p>To find out about <strong>Gantry Layouts</strong> and <strong>Widget Widths</strong>, check out this screencast which covers basic concepts of configuring layout with a combination of widget setting and the Gantry layout control.</p>\r\n\r\n<a class=\"readon smallmargintop\" href=\"http://gantry-framework.org/documentation/wordpress/configure/layouts\" target=\"_blank\"><span>View : Using Gantry Layouts</span></a>\";s:6:\"filter\";b:0;s:12:\"widget-style\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"box-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"title-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"block-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"shadow-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"corner-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"align-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"margin-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"padding-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"title-style\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"custom-variations\";s:0:\"\";}i:30010;a:14:{s:5:\"title\";s:33:\"Advanced: Adding Widget Positions\";s:4:\"text\";s:768:\"<a rel=\"rokbox[745 505]\" title=\"Video Tutorial :: Widget Positions\" href=\"http://gantry-framework.org/videos/wordpress/widget_positions.mp4\">\r\n  <img class=\"rt-image rt-floatleft\" src=\"http://www.comunacorcova.ro/wp-content/rockettheme/rt_ximenia_wp/widget-positions/module-positions.jpg\" alt=\"Widge Positions\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /></a>\r\n\r\n<p>Check out this quick screencast on <strong>Widget Positions</strong> to get an overview of how widget positions work within Gantry Framework. Click below to learn how to <strong>add a new row of widget positions</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<a class=\"readon smallmargintop\" href=\"http://gantry-framework.org/documentation/wordpress/customize/adding-widget-positions\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Learn : Adding Widget Positions</span></a>\";s:6:\"filter\";b:0;s:12:\"widget-style\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"box-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"title-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"block-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"shadow-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"corner-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"align-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"margin-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"padding-variation\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"title-style\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"custom-variations\";s:0:\"\";}s:12:\"_multiwidget\";i:1;}s:20:\"widget_gantrydivider\";a:2:{i:30007;a:0:{}s:12:\"_multiwidget\";i:1;}}','yes'),
