(1483,1,'2016-08-04 04:43:14','2016-08-04 04:43:14','<div class=\"rt-image rt-floatleft largemarginbottom\">\n  <img src=\"http://www.comunacorcova.ro/dosare/imagini/design/frontpage/center/budget.jpg\" width=\"327\" height=\"180\" alt=\"image\" />\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n<h2>Situatia Financiara</h2>\n\n<p>Facem publica situatia financiară a Comunei Corcova in anul 2016 pentru informarea si transparenţa privind <strong>investiţiile</strong>, proiectele dar şi cheltuielile ce se săvârşesc la nivel de comună pentru binele oamenilor, administraţia comunei, şi îmbunătăţirea nivelului de trai al comunităţii</p>\n\n<a class=\"readon\" href=\"#\"><span>See More</span></a>\n\n<div class=\"roksocialbuttons addthis_toolbox \"\naddthis:url=\"http://www.comunacorcova.ro\"\naddthis:title=\"Comuna Corcova\"\n\"\">\n<div class=\"custom_images\">\n<!-- <a class=\"addthis_button_twitter\"><span></span></a> --!>\n<a class=\"addthis_button_facebook\" href=\"http://facebook.com\"><span></span></a>\n<!-- <a class=\"addthis_button_google\"><span></span></a> --!>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"clear\"></div>','Stylistic Widgets','','inherit','closed','closed','','1350-autosave-v1','','','2016-08-04 04:43:14','2016-08-04 04:43:14','',1350,'http://www.comunacorcova.ro/1350-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),
(1484,1,'2016-08-02 03:26:44','2016-08-02 03:26:44','<div class=\"rt-image rt-floatleft largemarginbottom\">\r\n  <img src=\"http://www.comunacorcova.ro/wp-content/rockettheme/rt_ximenia_wp/frontpage/general/featured-1.jpg\" width=\"327\" height=\"180\" alt=\"image\" />\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n\r\n<h2>Stylistic Widgets</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Ximenia template has a series of <strong>widget variations</strong> that can be used to individualize your widgetized content. There are both <strong>stylistic</strong> and structure widget <strong>variations</strong>, which can change the style or dimensions of the widget.</p>\r\n\r\n<a class=\"readon\" href=\"#\"><span>See More</span></a>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"roksocialbuttons addthis_toolbox \"addthis:url=\"http://demo.rockettheme.com/live/wordpress/ximenia/stylistic-widgets/\"addthis:title=\"Stylistic Widgets\">\r\n<div class=\"custom_images\"><a class=\"addthis_button_twitter\"><span></span></a><a class=\"addthis_button_facebook\"><span></span></a><a class=\"addthis_button_google\"><span></span></a>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>','Stylistic Widgets','','inherit','closed','closed','','1350-revision-v1','','','2016-08-02 03:26:44','2016-08-02 03:26:44','',1350,'http://www.comunacorcova.ro/1350-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),
(1485,1,'2016-08-02 03:27:26','2016-08-02 03:27:26','<div class=\"rt-image rt-floatleft largemarginbottom\">\r\n  <img src=\"http://www.comunacorcova.ro/wp-content/rockettheme/rt_ximenia_wp/frontpage/general/featured-2.jpg\" width=\"327\" height=\"180\" alt=\"image\" />\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n\r\n<h2>Dynamic Layouts</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The widget <strong>positions</strong> are collapsible, meaning that if no widgets are published to a particular position and/or row, it will not be rendered. Also, you can <strong>configure</strong> the layout format on a page <strong>by page</strong> basis, providing true flexibility.</p>\r\n\r\n<a class=\"readon\" href=\"#\"><span>See More</span></a>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"roksocialbuttons addthis_toolbox \"addthis:url=\"http://demo.rockettheme.com/live/wordpress/ximenia/stylistic-widgets/\"addthis:title=\"Stylistic Widgets\">\r\n<div class=\"custom_images\"><a class=\"addthis_button_twitter\"><span></span></a><a class=\"addthis_button_facebook\"><span></span></a><a class=\"addthis_button_google\"><span></span></a>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"clear\"></div>','Dynamic Layouts','','inherit','closed','closed','','1348-revision-v1','','','2016-08-02 03:27:26','2016-08-02 03:27:26','',1348,'http://www.comunacorcova.ro/1348-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),
